        <mxCell id="kp_flusher" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#7A1F8C&quot;&gt;cortex_kb_flusher.py (NEW · ~150 LoC daemon)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;NDJSON 兜底队列:&lt;br&gt;runtime/cortex/.kb_pending.ndjson + .kb_flushed.ndjson&lt;br&gt;每 5s / 50 行 batch POST&lt;br&gt;cortex 不可达期 T2/T3 不阻塞主 loop&lt;br&gt;crash recovery 读 .kb_sid resume + drain pending&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;由 robustness 检活&lt;/b&gt; (复用 robustness_monitor.sh.example 模式)&lt;br&gt;CLOSE 阶段必须等 flusher drain 或显式 abort" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4ECFB;strokeColor=#7A1F8C;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
