        <mxCell id="kp_pr" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#7A1F8C&quot;&gt;PR Monitor Client&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;knowledge_plane/pr_monitor_client.py (urllib stdlib · 不引新依赖)&lt;br&gt;REST: pr_list / pr_get / pr_search (Coordinator 预热 pr_feed)&lt;br&gt;后端: primus-cortex-pr-api (REST + MCP)&lt;br&gt;6 仓库预抓 · 50Gi PVC 缓存 · 不打 GitHub API&lt;br&gt;ROCm/aiter · ROCm/FlyDSL · ROCm/hip · ROCm/vllm&lt;br&gt;sgl-project/sglang · triton-lang/triton&lt;br&gt;commit-level 文件树 + PR baseline (cherry-pick 判断)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;specialist&lt;/b&gt; 通过 MCP server 直接挂 12 个 readonly tool" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4ECFB;strokeColor=#7A1F8C;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
